TechMart Worldwide Shipping Policy:
- Free Standard Express Shipping on all orders above $49.99.
- Standard Delivery: 2-3 business days within continental USA & Europe.
- Priority Overnight Shipping available for $14.99 at checkout.
- Real-time tracking numbers dispatched via email & SMS upon shipment.
